1
00:00:00,369 --> 00:00:04,459
(Sheldon:)You once had Leonard and me
get your television from your ex-boyfriend.

2
00:00:05,749 --> 00:00:08,129
(Penny:)Apples and oranges here, Sheldon.

3
00:00:09,211 --> 00:00:12,631
(Penny:)I'm telling you, that girl is a user,
skating through life on her looks...

4
00:00:12,839 --> 00:00:14,589
...taking advantage of innocent men...

5
00:00:14,800 --> 00:00:17,430
(Penny:)...getting auditions
for stupid network shows.

6
00:00:17,636 --> 00:00:20,176
It just creams my corn.

7
00:00:22,516 --> 00:00:24,476
- May I interject something here?
- Please.

8
00:00:24,685 --> 00:00:26,315
(Sheldon:)You got the wrong mustard.

9
00:00:29,940 --> 00:00:32,820
(Sheldon:)- Hi.
- Hi.

10
00:00:33,026 --> 00:00:35,616
(Alicia:)Guess what? I got the part on CSI.

11
00:00:35,821 --> 00:00:38,111
(Penny:)Oh, boy.

12
00:00:39,032 --> 00:00:40,112
(Alicia:)Something wrong?

13
00:00:40,325 --> 00:00:42,285
(Sheldon:)No, no, no.
You know what? Congratulations.

14
00:00:42,494 --> 00:00:45,284
(Penny:)I think you'll make a great hooker.

15
00:00:46,123 --> 00:00:47,333
(Leonard:)Thank you.

16
00:00:47,958 --> 00:00:50,588
Hey, I gotta ask you something.

17
00:00:50,794 --> 00:00:52,754
(Alicia:)How much do physicists make?

18
00:00:53,880 --> 00:00:55,590
Um... Ah.

19
00:00:55,757 --> 00:00:57,847
(Penny:)I don't know. I don't think a lot.

20
00:00:58,051 --> 00:01:02,021
(Alicia:)Yeah, that's what I figured.

